{'symbol': 'DISH', 'date': '2021-07-19 06:30:00', 'title': 'DISH AND AT&T SIGN STRATEGIC NETWORK SERVICES AGREEMENT', 'text': 'LITTLETON, COLO. AND DALLAS, JULY 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DISH (NASDAQ:DISH), ANNOUNCED TODAY THE SIGNING OF A\xa0TRANSFORMATIVE, LONG-TERM STRATEGIC NETWORK SERVICES AGREEMENT (NSA) WITH AT&T, MAKING AT&T THE PRIMARY\xa0NETWORK SERVICES PARTNER FOR DISH MVNO CUSTOMERS.'}